          "value": "<p>While using Survival to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.49y9Ec4bDii8pcD3]{Subsist}, if the tracker rolls a failure or a critical failure, they get a success instead. If the tracker rolls a success, they can provide food for 16 additional creatures that eat about as much as a human, or 32 creatures on a critical success.</p>"
        },
