      "sort": 900000,
      "type": "action",
      "folder": null,
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "gm": "",
          "value": "<p>The tracker designates a single creature they can see and hear, or one they're @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Tracking}, as their prey. The tracker gains a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.BlAOM2X92SI6HMtJ]{Seek} the prey and to Survival checks to @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.EA5vuSgJfiHH7plD]{Track} the prey.</p>\n<p>The first time the tracker hits the designated prey in a round, they deal an additional [[/r 1d8[precision]]]{1d8 precision damage}. The tracker also ignores the penalty for making ranged attacks within their second range increment.</p>\n<p>These effects last until the tracker uses @Compendium[pf2e.actionspf2e.JYi4MnsdFu618hPm]{Hunt Prey} again.</p>"
        },
